{"version":1,"content":"<p>歐盟執行機構歐盟委員會近日表示，其遭遇了一場利用人工智能工具發起的網絡攻擊，可能導致大量個人信息泄露。由於相關調查仍在進行，委員會目前尚難以準確判斷事件的影響範圍。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587238.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T06:44:07.207308+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":87,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T06:24:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T06:37:14.515185+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T06:37:14.515185+00:00","content_hash":"e8b10249352dbc38d594701e56e9c7de77d6acc592afad4740ad1cc93cb2796f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}